; DNS zone file for 123of.net -> GitHub Pages (vinpatel/123ofnet)
; Import this file at your DNS provider (Cloudflare: DNS > Records > Import and Export;
; GoDaddy: DNS > Import Zone File). Remove any old A/AAAA/CNAME records for @ and www first.
;
; If you use Cloudflare, set these records to "DNS only" (grey cloud), not proxied,
; so GitHub can issue the HTTPS certificate.

$ORIGIN 123of.net.
$TTL 3600

; Apex domain -> GitHub Pages (IPv4)
@       IN  A       185.199.108.153
@       IN  A       185.199.109.153
@       IN  A       185.199.110.153
@       IN  A       185.199.111.153

; Apex domain -> GitHub Pages (IPv6)
@       IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8000::153
@       IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8001::153
@       IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8002::153
@       IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8003::153

; www -> GitHub Pages (redirects to 123of.net)
www     IN  CNAME   vinpatel.github.io.
